OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after large       
OL,4,Asinkhole appears                       
OL,6,FHomes have been evacuated after a      
OL,7,Fsinkhole measuring about 9ft deep (3m) 
OL,8,Fsuddenly opened up in a street in Kent.
OL,10,FAn area has been cordoned off after the
OL,11,Fhole measuring approximately 32ft (10m)
OL,12,Flong first appeared in Halstead Walk,  
OL,13,FAllington, Maidstone, in the early     
OL,14,Fhours of Thursday morning.             
OL,16,FThree properties were evacuated        
OL,17,Ffollowing what Kent County Council     
OL,18,Fofficials described as a "significant  
OL,19,Fground collapse", as they sought to    
OL,20,Funderstand what caused it. "It is too  
OL,21,Fearly to say how long repairs may      
OL,22,Ftake," a spokesperson says.            
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
